# ⚙️ Installation

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/FPGA-Image-Enhancement.git

cd FPGA-Image-Enhancement
```

## Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

# ▶️ Software Inference

Run the software inference pipeline:

```bash
python testing_code/test.py
```

### Input Directory

```bash
testing_images/degraded/
```

### Output Directory

```bash
output/
```

---

# ⚡ FPGA Deployment

The FPGA deployment workflow includes:

* INT8 quantization
* Vitis AI compilation
* `.xmodel` generation
* DPU execution
* FPGA runtime benchmarking

### Deployment Model

```bash
models/model_b8_c128_int.xmodel
```

---

# 🐳 Docker Support

Build Docker environment:

```bash
docker build -t fpga-enhancement .
```

Run container:

```bash
docker run -it fpga-enhancement
```

