# 🌍 Why This Project Matters

Efficient AI deployment on edge hardware is becoming increasingly important for:

* Smart surveillance systems
* Autonomous systems
* Embedded AI devices
* Low-power edge computing
* Real-time intelligent imaging

This project demonstrates how deep learning models can be optimized for practical FPGA deployment while maintaining strong enhancement performance.

